    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/statecrafting/statecraft-cli/zipball/v0.1.0",
    "body": "## What's Changed\n* feat(002): stagecraft crate scaffold, layered config, CI by @bartekus in https://github.com/statecrafting/statecraft-cli/pull/1\n* feat(003): auth + control-plane API client (login, whoami, api module) by @bartekus in https://github.com/statecrafting/statecraft-cli/pull/2\n* feat(004): governance verbs (tenants, stamps, fleet) over the API client by @bartekus in https://github.com/statecrafting/statecraft-cli/pull/3\n* feat(005): MCP stdio server exposing the governance verbs as tools by @bartekus in https://github.com/statecrafting/statecraft-cli/pull/4\n* feat(006): template upgrade verb (chassis upgrades as a governed local verb) by @bartekus in https://github.com/statecrafting/statecraft-cli/pull/5\n* fix(004): render live-plane shapes; complete 003/004/005 live checks by @bartekus in https://github.com/statecrafting/statecraft-cli/pull/6\n* Rename by @bartekus in https://github.com/statecrafting/statecraft-cli/pull/7\n* feat(007): release distribution (tag-gated prebuilt binaries + installer) by @bartekus in https://github.com/statecrafting/statecraft-cli/pull/8\n\n## New Contributors\n* @bartekus made their first contribution in https://github.com/statecrafting/statecraft-cli/pull/1\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/statecrafting/statecraft-cli/commits/v0.1.0",
